      "body": "It is accumulating \u2014 `glimpse()` was truncating the output so you couldn't see it. Switched to `print(n = Inf)`; the full table now shows:\n\n```\ndate       cost_usd rolling_cost_usd\n2026-10-05  0.319    0.319\n2026-10-07  0.028    0.347\n2026-10-08  0.007    0.354\n2026-10-09  0.004    0.359\n2026-10-11  0.038    0.396\n2026-10-12  0.848    1.24\n2026-10-14  0.003    1.25\n```\n\n`cumsum()` is running correctly; `cost_usd` stays daily and `rolling_cost_usd` grows.",
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::OpenCodeAcpPersona",
      "id": "d7f293cb-e6a9-421e-8aef-fcc172f5eb01",
